{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20536","headline":"寒食内宴二首 一 · 张籍","name":"寒食内宴二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝光瑞气满宫楼，彩纛鱼龙四面稠。\n廊下御厨分冷食，殿前香骑逐飞球。\n千官尽醉犹教坐，百戏皆呈未放休。\n共喜拜恩侵夜出，金吾不敢问行由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}